(19138,0,0,'May it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Attendant'),
(19188,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Raging Colossus'),
(19191,0,0,'What insolence! What arrogance! To believe you could defeat me on my own doorstep!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arazzius the Cruel'),
(19191,1,0,'Master, I have failed...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Arazzius the Cruel'),
(19196,0,0,'I feel that war is fast approaching.  The fruit vendor has enlisted the help of an ogre.  I shall have to enlist help as well.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Cro Threadstrong'),
(19196,1,0,'FRUIT VENDOR!!! Your cart is still in our way!  We will give you one more hour to move it from our area.  Do not test our patience anymore!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Cro Threadstrong'),
(19223,0,0,'I could have sworn I had more apples.  Grok!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Granny Smith'),
(19223,1,0,'What is that poor orc yelling about? Someone should see what is going on.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Granny Smith'),
(19227,0,0,'Hey! Hey, $r! I be havin\' just the thing for ya. Ya ever see a tikbalang? Frightenin\' creatures. Prone to stealin\' ya away. What ya need is one of my tikbalang wards. Guaranteed to ward away all tikbalangs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,0,1,'Look over here, $c! I got somethin\' for ya. Just what ya need. It\'s soap, right... and it\'s on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I\'m sayin\'?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,0,2,'C\'mere, $r. Ya don\'t want to be riskin\' yerself in a dungeon, do ya? Filthy work, and for what? Some worthless trinket? Nah, what ya need be one of my amulets. Guaranteed to work!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,1,0,'Ya look tired, $c. I be havin\' somethin\' for ya. These amulets, they can help ya leap obstacles and swim through the rivers like ya be born to it. They energize the food ya be eatin\', makin\' yer wounds close before yer eyes!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,1,1,'Hey! Hey, $r! I be havin\' just the thing for ya. Ya ever see a tikbalang? Frightenin\' creatures. Prone to stealin\' ya away. What ya need is one of my tikbalang wards. Guaranteed to ward away all tikbalangs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,1,2,'Look over here, $c! I got somethin\' for ya. Just what ya need. It\'s soap, right... and it\'s on a rope! No offense, $G man:honey;, but yer a little ripe, know what I\'m sayin\'?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,2,0,'Ya look lovesick. Special someone be gettin\' ya down, eh? No worries, no worries. Ya get this medallion from me, ya wear it when ya see \'em, and they be all over ya, $G man:sweetheart;!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,2,1,'Amazing amulets! Incredible curios! The newfangled jewelcrafters be havin\' nothin\' on the tried and true mystical methods of ol\' Griftah! Improve yerself through these magical talismans for a bargain price!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19227,2,2,'Dangerous out there, innit? Know what ya need? Protection. I can help ya defy death itself! Ya wear this madstone \'round yer neck, see, and then ya be able to come back if ya find yerself in the spirit world! Just a quick jaunt to yer corpse and up ya come, fresh and new!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Griftah'),
(19228,0,0,'Hey all!  So how long until the jokes spawn?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,1,'I just flew in from Ironforge and, Boy!, are my mount\'s wings tired!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,2,'Hey folks, go easy on me... it\'s my first time.',12,0,100,24,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,3,'Thanks for coming out to see me!  I hope you are ready for a good time, because I am.',12,0,100,21,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,4,'Whoa!  Is all that applause for me?  Thanks for coming out!',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,5,'What a good looking crowd. The dwarven women even shaved.',12,0,100,21,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,0,6,'Are you ready to laugh!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,3,0,'Last week I was in Goldshire. Have you been there?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,4,0,'That town\'s so small, I asked a kid to draw me a map. He drew it on the back of a Defias wanted poster...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,5,0,'to scale!!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,6,0,'Impersonation time!!  I call this, "The Silly Tauren."',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,7,0,'The comedian clears his throat.',16,0,100,0,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,8,0,'The comedian impersonates a tauren.',16,0,100,5,0,6386,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,11,0,'What\'s the deal with women?  I mean they are always like...',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,12,0,'The comedian impersonates a human female.',16,0,100,5,0,6143,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,13,0,'And then gnomes are even worse!  They are always saying stuff like...',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,14,0,'The comedian impersonates a gnome.',16,0,100,5,0,6133,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,17,0,'If I knew it was going to be like this, I\'d have worn my Greater Boots of Laughter.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,17,1,'Apparently my reputation with you people is hostile.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,17,2,'Wow!  The laughs don\'t drop very often here, do they?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,17,3,'Can I get a buff? I\'m dying up here.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,17,4,'Come on!  These jokes are epic!',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,20,0,'The gnomes used to be a nice respectful people...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,21,0,'The other day I saw one walking down the street shouting, "Once you go gnome, you never go home!"',12,0,100,1,0,4415,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,22,0,'I love blood elf women.  Especially when they say stuff like this...',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,23,0,'The comedian impersonates a blood elf.',16,0,100,5,0,9643,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,26,0,'One last impersonation.  It\'s tough, but let\'s see if you can guess who it is...',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,27,0,'The comedian impersonates an orc.',16,0,100,5,0,7195,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,28,0,'Now that the show\'s done, can someone run me through Scarlet Monestary?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,28,1,'Thank you! Don\'t forget to tip your waiters! Good night folks.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,28,2,'Well, it\'s time to take these comedic muscles elsewhere. Have a good night all!',12,0,100,23,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,28,3,'Is it over already?  You\'ve been great folks.  Walk safely and have a good night.',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19228,28,4,'Thank you everyone!  And keep clapping, there is a fly in here and one of you are bound to get it!  Good night!',12,0,100,21,0,0,'Perry Gatner'),
(19283,0,0,'Please don\'t ignore us...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Vagrant'),
(19283,0,1,'Spare a copper, $G sir:madam;?',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Vagrant'),
(19283,0,2,'Hey, $G man:lady;? Got some money?  I got five kids to feed!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Vagrant'),
(19283,0,3,'Any spare copper?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Vagrant - Random Talk'),
(19308,0,0,'This war - and don\'t mistake this for anything but a war - is not going to win itself. If we do not fight, scratch, claw, and kick for every speck of land on this shattered world, all will be lost.',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Marshal Isildor'),
(19308,0,1,'How many more soldiers need to die before we start paying attention out there?',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Marshal Isildor'),
(19308,0,2,'Do you think that demons will play fair? These beasts are more savage than orcs and more cunning than the undead. Do not attempt to engage Legion by normal standards of war.',12,7,100,5,0,0,'Marshal Isildor'),
(19308,0,3,'I regret to inform you all that we sent home another ten soldiers today - in body bags.',12,7,100,1,0,0,'Marshal Isildor'),
(19346,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen, I have a request to make of you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),
(19346,1,0,'We\'ve just sent another inexperienced squad into Nagrand. Might you offer a prayer for them?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),
(19346,2,0,'May it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Harbinger Erothem'),
(19362,0,0,'If I see any lazy peons here, I\'ll load them into a catapult and launch them off to the Black Temple!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Defender'),
(19362,0,1,'Any time any of you peons want to take a break, the graveyard is right over there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Kor\'kron Defender'),
(19378,0,0,'Of course, my friend. How can I be of service to you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,1,0,'A noble request. It would be an honor, Erothem.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,2,0,'My friends, please join me in humble supplication to the Light.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,3,0,'Light that we embrace, we beseech thee...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,4,0,'Into our struggle against the darkness we have sent our children.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,5,0,'Please bless and protect them, and grant them success over those who seek to do us harm...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,6,0,'Continue to bless this, our ancient home, we beg.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,7,0,'Bless us with tolerance for our elven visitors.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
(19378,8,0,'By the naaru, may it be so.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Anchorite Nindumen'),
