(28793,0,1,'Your disguise doesn\'t fool me, fleshling! Your defeat will please Drakuru!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Darmuk'),
(28907,0,0,'The sky itself feeds upon the suffering of the conquered! ',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,1,0,'The Scarlet Crusade is powerless to stop us! ',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,2,0,'The corpses of those that try only serve to feed our expanding host!',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,3,0,'The Scarlet fleet lies in ruin upon the sundered coast! ',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,4,0,'With each enemy slain, our strength grows! We mustn\'t relent!  ',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,5,0,'The Lich King has spoken to each of you! Let his words resonate among you once more!',12,0,100,25,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,6,0,'ALL. MUST. DIE.',12,0,100,22,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,7,0,'Leave no survivors in your wake, brothers and sisters!',12,0,100,274,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,8,0,'No mercy for the weak!',12,0,100,15,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,9,0,'TERROR!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,10,0,'CHAOS!',12,0,100,22,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,11,0,'DESTRUCTION!',12,0,100,15,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,12,0,'With the approaching darkness comes the end of the Scarlet Crusade. You will battle once more! For the Scourge! For the Lich King!',12,0,100,5,0,0,'Prince Valanar'),
(28907,13,0,'SUFFER WELL, DEATH KNIGHTS!',12,0,100,71,0,9006,'Prince Valanar'),
(28917,0,0,'Daddy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Yara'),
(28948,0,0,'Ahh... there you are. The master told us you\'d be arriving soon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,1,0,'Please, follow me, $n. There is much for you to see....',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,3,0,'You should feel honored. You are the first of the master\'s prospects to be shown our operation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,4,0,'The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,5,0,'Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,6,0,'I understand that you are to thank for the bulk of our supply.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,7,0,'These trolls are among those you exposed on the battlefield. Masterfully done, indeed....',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,8,0,'We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,9,0,'This is their destiny....',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,10,0,'The blight slowly seeps into their bodies, gradually preparing them for their conversion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,11,0,'This special preparation grants them unique powers far greater than they would otherwise know.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,12,0,'Soon, the master will grant them the dark gift, making them fit to serve the Lich King for eternity!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,13,0,'Stay for as long as you like, $n. Glory in the fruits of your labor!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
(28948,14,0,'Your service has been invaluable in fulfilling the master\'s plan. May you forever grow in power....',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Malmortis say'),
