(42598,0,0,'Initiating cleanup ... ...',12,0,100,0,0,0,'GS-9x Multi-Bot'),
(42655,0,0,'The gnolls have failed, mistress.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker to Helix\'s Lumbering Oaf'),
(42655,1,0,'But mistress, the admiral is sti...',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker to Shadowy Figure'),
(42655,2,0,'Yes, mistress.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker to Shadowy Figure'),
(42655,3,0,'Moonbrook, mistress?',12,0,100,6,0,0,'Helix Gearbreaker to Shadowy Figure'),
(42662,0,0,'They provided the distraction I required. We continue as planned.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Shadowy Figure to Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42662,1,0,'We will free the admiral during the dawning.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Shadowy Figure to Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42662,2,0,'Judgment day is soon upon us, Helix.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Shadowy Figure to Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42662,3,0,'Call for the people. I wish to speak to them one last time before the dawning.',12,0,100,1,0,0,'Shadowy Figure to Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42662,4,0,'Aye. Tonight.',12,0,100,273,0,0,'Shadowy Figure to Helix Gearbreaker'),
(42680,0,0,'The rally is about to begin!',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(42680,1,0,'Gather, brothers and sisters! Come, all, and listen!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(42680,2,0,'Brothers. Sisters. We are ABANDONED - the orphaned children of Stormwind.',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,3,0,'Our "king" sits atop his throne made of gold and shrugs at our plight!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,4,0,'Meanwhile, our children die of starvation on these very streets!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,5,0,'HIS war, not ours, cost us our livelihood. WE paid for the Alliance\'s victories with our blood and the blood of our loved ones!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,6,0,'The time has come, brothers and sisters, to stop this injustice!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,7,0,'The government of Stormwind, of the ALLIANCE, must be made accountable for what it has done to us!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42680,8,0,'Today, we are reborn! Today, we take a stand as men and women, not nameless, faceless numbers!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(42707,0,0,'Cover the door - we\'ve got him!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Twilight Nightblade to Player'),
(42709,0,0,'Oh no not de bar! Take it outside, mon!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Gravy to Player'),
(43003,0,0,'The blade cuts into the Mosh\'Ogg Bounty, forcing it open!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Venture Co. Sawblade'),
(43919,0,0,'Woo hoo.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Osborn Obnoticus'),
(43920,0,0,'Thank you!  I don\'t know how much longer we would have survived.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Emerine Junis'),
(43920,1,0,'That cage was stifling my magic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Emerine Junis'),
(43920,2,0,'If you don\'t mind, I\'m going to teleport us back to the Rebel Camp.  We\'ll thank you in person later.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Emerine Junis'),
(43921,0,0,'Freedom!  Sweet, sweet freedom!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Berrin Burnquill'),
(44768,0,0,'Thank you... I wish I could help you find the forgemaster.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Enslaved Miner to Player'),
(44768,0,1,'The forgemaster\'s a terrible murderer.  Are you sure you want to go looking for him?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44768,0,2,'Ah, yes... I know about the forgemaster!  I just overheard that he\'s not in the camp right now.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44768,0,3,'The forgemaster is meeting with the Twilight leadership.  Trust me, I traded some gossip for a loaf of stale bread!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44768,0,4,'I don\'t know nothin\' bout no forgemaster.  Now tell me where this safe place you came from is!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(44768,0,5,'I heard the forgemaster keeps notes about his meetings  in a book at the tower overlooking the camp.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
