(52204,0,0,'Wow, wow, wow! I can\'t believe Sputtervalve actually let me drive this baby! Have I mentioned this is my first time flying? Don\'t worry though. I have everything under control.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Gyrotilt'),
(52204,1,0,'Man, oh man...Just look at that amazing view! Are those LIONS? Oops, almost let go of the steering wheel there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Gyrotilt'),
(52204,2,0,'My dream is to be as brilliant as Sputtervalve someday. You should see his design for a two-wheeled tricycle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Gyrotilt'),
(52204,3,0,'Well here we are, back at the Crossroads, safe and sound.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Gyrotilt'),
